<title>BRAZIL: Brazil coffee forecast for private clients - Yallouz.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee forecast for private clients - Yallouz.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private coffee consultant Leon Yallouz has released his second estimate of the 1997/98 Brazilian crop but the information has only been made available to private clients, Yallouz told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;I released my second estimate yesterday but I have no intention of commenting on Brazil's 1997/98 crop,&quot; Yallouz said.</p>
<p>Yallouz formerly was the coffee crop forecaster for U.S. Agriculture Department, but this year started a private consultancy service which centers on Brazilian crop predictions.</p>
<p>((--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro +55 21 507 4151))</p>
